<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The full 3-square mark (same relative geometry as AppLogoMark.kt / ChaseLoadingIndicator),
     shown as the OS-level splash icon so the system's mandatory pre-draw splash (Android 12+)
     bridges into the real animation on the same brand mark, instead of the default
     launcher-icon placeholder. Scaled to ~70% and centered in a square viewport (unlike
     AppLogoMark's tight 72x60 box) because windowSplashScreenAnimatedIcon is masked into a
     circular safe zone by the OS, the same way adaptive icon foregrounds are - the original
     edge-to-edge mark got its outer corners clipped without this margin. -->
